        "name:en": "EK D 396 Hullebaek",
        "name:da": "EK D 396 Hullebæk",
        "startCoordIndex": 1
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p><em></em>&nbsp;I forbindelse med skydning etableres et midlertidigt afsp&aelig;rringsomr&aring;de p&aring; s&oslash;en ud for skydepladsen p&aring; position:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>55&deg; 01'N - 014&deg; 55'E.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p>Skydepladsen omfatter to omr&aring;der: Hulleb&aelig;k (indre omr&aring;de) og Raghammer Odde (ydre omr&aring;de). N&aring;r der skydes i Raghammer Odde, skydes der i begge omr&aring;der.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>In connection with firing practices, a temporary prohibited area is established on the sea off the firing practice at position:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>55&deg; 01'N - 014&deg; 55'E.</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p>The firing practice area covers two areas: Hulleb&aelig;k (inner area) and Raghammer Odde (outer area). When firing is practiced in Raghammer Odde, firing is practiced in both areas.</p>"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "indexNo": 0,
    "type": "PROHIBITION",
    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p>Under skydning er al sejlads, ankring og fiskeri forbudt i afspærringsområdet.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>During firing practices, all navigation, anchoring and fishing are prohibited in the area.</p>"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "indexNo": 0,
    "type": "SIGNALS",
    "geometry": {
     "type": "FeatureCollection",
     "id": "0afa3a9f-08b3-4e73-b0d7-89f90b5b84b5",
     "features": [
      {
       "type": "Feature",
       "id": "a9141c98-7626-41c8-93ee-f2ea5fc83270",
       "geometry": {
        "type": "MultiPoint",
        "coordinates": [
         [
          14.908,
          55.023
         ],
         [
          14.955166666666667,
          55.0065
         ]
        ]
       },
       "properties": {
        "name:0:en": "Signal mast 1.",
        "name:1:en": "Signal mast 2.",
        "startCoordIndex": 6,
        "name:0:da": "Signalmast 1.",
        "name:1:da": "Signalmast 2."
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p>At skydning foreg&aring;r, tilkendegives ved, at der fra en time f&oslash;r skydningens p&aring;begyndelse og indtil dens oph&oslash;r vises f&oslash;lgende signaler:</p>\n<table class=\"no-border\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span>a)</span></td>\n<td>\n<p><span>I dagslys hejses en kugle p&aring; signalmast 1 og 2.</span></p>\n<p><span>Desuden t&aelig;ndes p&aring; begge signalmaster et hvidt, blinkende fyr (60 blink pr. minut).</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span>b)</span></td>\n<td><span>I m&oslash;rke t&aelig;ndes p&aring; begge signalmaster fyr, der viser r&oslash;dt og hvidt vekselblink (30 blink pr. minut).</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>55<span>&deg;</span> 01,38'N - 014<span>&deg;</span> 54,48'E, signalmast 1.</li>\n<li>55<span>&deg;</span> 00,39'N - 014<span>&deg;</span> 57,31'E, signalmast 2.</li>\n</ul>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>Information about firing practices is given by displaying the following signals from one hour before the start of the firing practice until its end:</p>\n<table class=\"no-border\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>a)</td>\n<td>\n<p>By daylight, a sphere is hoisted at signal mast 1 and 2.</p>\n<p>In addition, a white, flashing light is lit on both signal masts (60 flashes per minute).</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b)</td>\n<td>In darkness, lights displaying a red and a white alternating flash are lit on both signal masts (30 flashes per minute).</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>55<span>&deg;</span> 01,38'N - 014<span>&deg;</span> 54,48'E, signal mast 1.</li>\n<li>55<span>&deg;</span> 00,39'N - 014<span>&deg;</span> 57,31'E, signal mast 2.</li>\n</ul>"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "indexNo": 0,
    "type": "NOTE",
    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p>Oplysning om skydning kan indhentes ved Sikkerhedskontoret, tlf. 5697 8106 / 2010 6551 eller over VHF-radio. Kaldenavn: Raghammer. Kaldekanal: 16. Samtalekanaler: 6, 8 og 77. Radioen er &aring;ben fra en time f&oslash;r skydningens p&aring;begyndelse og indtil dens oph&oslash;r.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>Information about firing practices is available from the safety office, tel. +45 0000 0001 /&nbsp;+45 0000 0002, or over VHF radio. Call name: Raghammer. Call channel: 16. Conversation channels: 6, 8 and 77. The radio is open from one hour before the start of the firing practice and until its end.</p>"
     }
    ]
   }
