    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p>I forbindelse med skydning i EK R 18 J&aelig;gerspris, etableres et midlertidigt afsp&aelig;rringsomr&aring;de p&aring; s&oslash;en ud for skydepladsen p&aring; position:</p>\n<ul class=\"positions\">\n<li>55&deg; 52'N - 011&deg; 57'E.</li>\n</ul>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>In connection with firing practices in EK R 18 J&aelig;gerspris, a temporary prohibited area is established on the sea off the firing practice area in position:</p>\n<ul class=\"positions\">\n<li>55&deg; 52'N - 011&deg; 57'E.</li>\n</ul>"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "indexNo": 0,
    "type": "PROHIBITION",
    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p>Under skydning er al sejlads, ankring og fiskeri forbudt i afspærringsområdet.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>During firing practices, all navigation, anchoring and fishing are prohibited in the area.</p>"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "indexNo": 0,
    "type": "SIGNALS",
    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p>At skydning foreg&aring;r, tilkendegives ved, at der fra en time f&oslash;r skydningens p&aring;begyndelse og indtil dens oph&oslash;r vises f&oslash;lgende signaler:</p>\n<table class=\"no-border\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>a)</td>\n<td>I dagslys hejses en kugle, og der t&aelig;ndes et hvidt, blinkende fyr (60 blink pr. minut) p&aring; signalmast 1 og 3.&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b)</td>\n<td><span>30 minutter f&oslash;r solnedgang t&aelig;ndes fyr, der viser r&oslash;dt og hvidt </span><span>vekselblink (30 blink pr. minut), p&aring; signalmast 1 og 3.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li><span>55</span><span>&deg;</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>51,57'N -</span>&nbsp;<span>011</span><span>&deg;</span><span><span>&nbsp;</span>57,33'E,&nbsp;</span>Signalmast 1 - ved observationspost Syd.</li>\n<li>55<span>&deg;</span> 54,00'N - 011<span>&deg;</span> 55,54<span>'</span>E, Signalmast 3 - ved kysten ved Storeh&oslash;j.</li>\n</ul>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>Information about firing practices is given by displaying the following signals from one hour before the start of the firing practice until its end:</p>\n<table class=\"no-border\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>a)</td>\n<td>By daylight, a sphere is hoisted and a white, flashing light is lit (60 flashes per minute) on signal mast 1 and 3.&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b)</td>\n<td><span> 30 minutes before sunset, lights displaying a red and white alternating flash </span><span>(30 flashes per minute) are lit on signal masts 1 and 3.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>55<span>&deg;</span> 51,57'N - 011<span>&deg;</span> 57,33'E, Signal mast 1 - <span>at the coast at observationspost Syd.</span></li>\n<li>55<span>&deg;</span> 54,00'N - 011<span>&deg;</span> 55,54<span>'</span>E, Signal mast 3 - <span>at the coast of Storeh&oslash;j.</span></li>\n</ul>"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "indexNo": 0,
    "type": "NOTE",
    "descs": [
     {
      "lang": "da",
      "details": "<p>Oplysning om skydning kan indhentes ved J&aelig;gersprislejren, tlf. 7283 9730 eller p&aring; <span style=\"color: #000000;\"> <a href=\"https://forsvaret.dk/da/oevelsesaktiviteter/\" style=\"color: #000000;\">https://forsvaret.dk/da/oevelsesaktiviteter</a>&nbsp;</span>eller over VHF-radio. Kaldenavn: J&aelig;gerspris. Kaldekanal: 16. Samtalekanaler: 6, 8, og 67. Radioen og telefon er &aring;ben fra en time f&oslash;r skydningens p&aring;begyndelse og indtil dens oph&oslash;r.</p>"
     },
     {
      "lang": "en",
      "details": "<p>Information about firing practices is available from Camp J&aelig;gerspris, tel. +45 0000 0003 or from&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://forsvaret.dk/da/oevelsesaktiviteter/\" style=\"color: #000000;\">https://forsvaret.dk/da/oevelsesaktiviteter</a></span>&nbsp;or over VHF radio. Call name: J&aelig;gerspris. Call channel: 16. Conversation channels: 6, 8, and 67. The radio and telephone are open from one hour before the start of the firing practice and until its end.</p>"
     }
    ]
